users/adamhewitt627","html_url":"https://github.com/adamhewitt627","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-04-04T14:01:58Z","updated_at":"2018-04-04T14:01:58Z","body":"```Java\r\nString key = Base64.encodeToString(new byte[]{(byte)0xB2, (byte)0xAB, (byte)0xE5, (byte)0x90, (byte)0x82, (byte)0x5D, (byte)0x82, (byte)0x27, (byte)0x1C, (byte)0xFC, (byte)0x06, (byte)0x06, (byte)0x06, (byte)0x3C, (byte)0x81, (byte)0x99}, Base64.URL_SAFE);\r\n\r\n//key == \"sqvlkIJdgicc_AYGBjyBmQ==\\n\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhile the encryption error _does_ go away using your key, I also don't get any audio. Using `00000000000000000000` as the key has the same effect.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/378610501/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"adamhewitt627","id":3036550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzY1NTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627","html_url":"https://github.com/adamhewitt627","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/followers","following_url":"https://a