ully. The correct key to use is `sqvlkIJdgicc_AYGBjyBmQ` (i.e. base64url encoding, as per spec).\r\n\r\nI think the problem is in `ClearKeyUtil.adjustResponseData`, which re-writes the response to accommodate the fact that the underlying CDM incorrectly expected base64 rather than base64url prior to O-MR1. It converts `_` into `/`, and also escapes `/` as `\\/` as per the JSON spec. It seems the underlying CDM does not expect or handle the escaping. If the escaping is removed then the content is able to play successfully.\r\n\r\nDo you agree with the above diagnosis? If so I can push a fix. Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/378640445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/378643443","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/4075#issuecomment-378643443","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/4075","id":378643443,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM3ODY0MzQ0Mw==","user":{"login":"adamhewitt627","id":3036550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzY1NTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627","html_url":"https://github.com/adamhewitt627","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamhewitt627/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-04-04T15:32:42Z","updated_at":"2018-04-04T15:32:42Z","body":"My sense was that there was an issue in that escaping, but I wasn't able to debug/bypass it myself. I hadn't heard of that requirement in JSON, and searching online suggests it's optional. PowerShell, for one, doesn't include it:\r\n```PowerShell\r\n@{\"test\"=\"value/text\"} | ConvertTo-Json -Compress  # {\"test\":\"value/text\"}\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/378643443/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"adamhewitt627","id":3036550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzY1NTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamh